Kids book idea time travel with microwave

Elinor was a usual kind of girl.
Brown hair. Brown eyes. Brown cat.

Like most usual girls, Elenors house had a kitchen. And a stove. And a sink. And a microwave time machine.

You know, the usual stuff

Wait, you what? No time travel ready microwave was provided with your home?